{"text": " Cum adic\u0103 \u00eenc\u0103 nu ai caban\u0103 de revelion? Haide\u021bi-v\u0103 ar\u0103t de o caban\u0103 pentru un revelion reu\u0219it \u0218i \u00een ce avem de afar\u0103 pentru c\u0103 da, pi\u0219ina este \u00eenc\u0103lzit\u0103 Cei mai frumos dec\u00e2t o pi\u0219in\u0103 \u00eenc\u0103lzit\u0103 iarna Plus un loc de foc aici Capacitatea acestei cabanii este de 18 persoane \u0218i eu spun c\u0103 chiar ar \u00eentrea 19 persoane Are un living foarte spa\u021bios unde pute\u021bi danse a\u021bi toat\u0103 si iar\u0103 Iar pre\u021bul este foarte bun, el spune la final Cuc\u0103t\u0103ria este complet utilat\u0103 \u0219i apropo afar\u0103 ave\u021bi \u0219i un gr\u0103tar pentru gr\u0103tarele de revelion Living te a\u0219tept\u0103 \u0219i aceast\u0103 zon\u0103, cu dou\u0103 canapele extensibile \u0219i un televizor imens, dac\u0103 \u00ee\u021bi v\u0103 m\u0103 \u00eentreba\u021bi b\u0103 mie Pe l\u00e2ng\u0103 acest living cabana distunie de 5 dormitoare \u0219i 4 b\u0103i Plus o teras\u0103 la etaj Iar cabana de revelion cost\u0103 18.000 de lei Iar data este flexibil\u0103, pute\u021bi o lege\u021bi voi \u00een func\u021bie de preferin\u021be Iar pentru rezerv\u0103ri, suna\u021bi la acest num\u0103r", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.0, "text": " Cum adic\u0103 \u00eenc\u0103 nu ai caban\u0103 de revelion?", "tokens": [50364, 26337, 614, 299, 4089, 15351, 66, 4089, 3822, 9783, 5487, 282, 4089, 368, 15262, 313, 30, 50464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.27803726196289064, "compression_ratio": 1.603921568627451, "no_speech_prob": 0.106655053794384}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.0, "end": 5.3, "text": " Haide\u021bi-v\u0103 ar\u0103t de o caban\u0103 pentru un revelion reu\u0219it", "tokens": [50464, 4064, 482, 19999, 12, 85, 4089, 594, 4089, 83, 368, 277, 5487, 282, 4089, 31718, 517, 15262, 313, 319, 84, 10355, 270, 50629], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.27803726196289064, "compression_ratio": 1.6039